          <p>The Site uses Google Analytics 4 for aggregate usage measurement \u2014 page views, feature usage, and which AI models are selected. It is configured with privacy defaults enabled: IP anonymization, Google Signals off, and ad personalization off. The Site does not log prompt text, Prompt Builder input, or anything else intended to identify you. Blocking analytics with a browser extension does not affect the Site's functionality.</p>
